{"title": "Dreamlike Aura: Acid", "pageid": 50317, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Dreamlike_Aura:_Acid", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Dreamlike Aura: Acid</b> is a passive feature exclusive to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Acid_Hallucination_(creature)\" title=\"Acid Hallucination (creature)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0c/Portrait_Acid_Hallucination.png/25px-Portrait_Acid_Hallucination.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0c/Portrait_Acid_Hallucination.png/38px-Portrait_Acid_Hallucination.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0c/Portrait_Acid_Hallucination.png/50px-Portrait_Acid_Hallucination.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Acid Hallucinations\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0c/Portrait_Acid_Hallucination.png/25px-Portrait_Acid_Hallucination.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0c/Portrait_Acid_Hallucination.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Acid_Hallucination_(creature)\" title=\"Acid Hallucination (creature)\">Acid Hallucinations</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Staying close to this creature grants <a href=\"/wiki/Resistance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Resistance\">Resistance</a> to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Acid\" title=\"Acid\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Acid\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Acid\" title=\"Acid\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-acid\">Acid</span></a> damage. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Acid_Resistance_Aura\"> Condition: Acid Resistance Aura </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Acid_Resistance_Aura_(Condition)\" title=\"Acid Resistance Aura (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/57/Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/57/Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/57/Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Acid Resistance Aura\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/57/Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/57/Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Acid_Resistance_Aura_(Condition)\" title=\"Acid Resistance Aura (Condition)\">Acid Resistance Aura</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>The fantastical powers of this hallucinatory imp give all nearby creatures <a href=\"/wiki/Resistance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Resistance\">Resistance</a> to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span cl